<title>FRANCE: France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, rye bids.</title>
<headline>France reports free-mkt wheat, barley, rye bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Oct 31 ---		 --- Oct 24---</p>
<p>MAIN TENDER</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  586,300   16.95-27.47	624,000    8.49-19.90</p>
<p> Barley	332,000   34.77-42.85	636,000   31.00-39.97</p>
<p> Rye	     3,000   Not given	   10,000   30.09-34.09</p>
<p>--- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
